# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/endings.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@ending ending_sent_home
# en: Sent Home
title [a6af26] = 被送回家
# en: The infirmary writes to your family. A carriage comes for you on a grey morning and you watch the towers shrink in the rear window. Your body gave out before your dreams did. Perhaps, one day, you will come back.
text [9741e7] = 医务室给你家里写了信。一个灰蒙蒙的早晨，马车来接你，你从后窗看着高塔渐渐缩小。你的身体先于你的梦想垮掉了。也许有一天，你还会回来。

@ending ending_quiet_departure
# en: The Quiet Departure
title [b17cb0] = 悄然离去
# en: You take the dawn barge without telling anyone. The academy does not notice right away; then, one by one, people do. Some of them write. You keep the letters in a box you don't open for years. When you finally do, you are someone gentler, and you find you are not alone.
text [e6ed08] = 你没告诉任何人，搭上了黎明的驳船。学院起初并没察觉；后来，人们一个接一个地发现了。有些人给你写了信。你把信收进一只盒子，好多年都没打开。等你终于打开时，你已变得更温柔，而且发现自己并不孤单。

@ending ending_expelled
# en: Expelled
title [a01536] = 开除学籍
# en: The Board's decision is final. Your wand is not taken — Lumenhold is not cruel — but your name is struck from the register in ink that cannot be unwritten. You walk out of the gates with a trunk and a lesson, and the long road ahead is entirely your own.
text [27607d] = 委员会的决定无法更改。你的魔杖没有被收走——流明堡并不残忍——但你的名字被一种无法抹去的墨水从名册上划掉了。你提着行李箱、带着一个教训走出校门，前方的漫漫长路，完全属于你自己。

@ending ending_hollow_claimed
# en: Claimed by the Hollow Star
title [83514d] = 被空洞之星吞噬
# en: You open the door beneath the lake. The Hollow Star looks back. For a moment you understand everything, and then there is no "you" left to understand it. On clear nights students swear they see a new star, black against black, right above the seventh tower.
text [205ca2] = 你打开了湖底之门。空洞之星回望着你。有那么一瞬间，你明白了一切；随后，再也没有一个“你”能去明白什么了。晴朗的夜里，学生们发誓看见了一颗新星——黑上之黑——就在第七塔的正上方。

@ending ending_runaway
# en: Gone With the Wind
title [d9dde5] = 随风而去
# en: You and Corvin leave Lumenhold on a stolen sky-barge at midnight, laughing so hard you can barely steer. The academy will tell the story for years — usually wrong. You never graduate. You don't regret it, mostly.
text [c5d68b] = 午夜时分，你和科尔文驾着一艘偷来的天空驳船离开了流明堡，笑得几乎掌不稳舵。学院会把这个故事讲上好多年——而且通常讲错。你始终没有毕业。你并不后悔，大体上。

@ending ending_hollow_keeper
# en: Keeper of the Hollow Star
title [3ac5e6] = 空洞之星的守护者
# en: You graduate with a black star on your palm and a voice in the back of your mind that is not entirely yours. The Hollow Star gave you power; it will want something back. For now, the towers bow a little when you pass, and even the headmistress looks away first.
text [8bdf91] = 你毕业时，掌心带着一颗黑色的星，脑海深处还有一个不完全属于你的声音。空洞之星给了你力量；它总有一天会要回些什么。至于现在，你经过时高塔都会微微低头，连院长都会先移开目光。

@ending ending_hollow_freed
# en: Herald of the Hollow Star
title [5e0dc6] = 空洞之星的使者
# en: The spring the lake froze, the Star went free, and you held the door. It did not swallow you; it remembered who let it out. The Northern families write to you as one of their own now, and wherever you walk, candles burn a little lower, as if bowing. Lumenhold still hands you a diploma. Nobody at the ceremony looks you in the eye.
text [0ea418] = 湖面冰封的那个春天，星挣脱而去，而为它扶住门的是你。它没有吞掉你；它记得是谁放它出来的。如今北境的世家把你当作自家人来写信，你走到哪里，烛火便低下去一点，像在鞠躬。流明堡照样发给你毕业证书。典礼上没有一个人敢直视你的眼睛。

@ending ending_hollow_hero
# en: Warden of Lumenhold
title [1eb489] = 流明堡的守望者
# en: The academy will never fully know what you did beneath the lake. The headmistress does. At graduation she gives you a silver key without a lock and a seat among the Wardens, the quiet few who keep the old doors closed. Kael stands in the crowd and, for once, he is smiling.
text [fff990] = 学院永远不会完全知道你在湖底做了什么。院长知道。毕业典礼上，她交给你一把没有锁的银钥匙，以及守望者中的一席之地——那是守护古老之门、默默无闻的少数人。凯尔站在人群里，难得地，他在微笑。

@ending ending_archmage
# en: The Archmage's Path
title [fea2fb] = 大法师之路
# en: Graduating with highest honours and a power that makes the candles lean toward you, you are offered an apprenticeship with the Conclave of the Seven Towers. Professor Thorne shakes your hand and says, gruffly, "Don't waste it." You won't.
text [e7e723] = 你以最高荣誉毕业，力量强到烛火都会向你倾斜。七塔议会向你发出了学徒邀约。索恩教授握着你的手，粗声说：“别浪费了。”你不会的。

@ending ending_scholar
# en: Scholar of the Spire
title [02e34a] = 尖塔学者
# en: Your thesis is shelved in the Spire Library, in the section students whisper about. The faculty offers you a junior fellowship. You will spend your life among books that bite and secrets that wait — and you could not be happier.
text [ea44fe] = 你的论文被收进了尖塔图书馆，就在学生们窃窃私语的那个区域。学院为你提供了初级研究员的职位。你将在会咬人的书和静静等待的秘密之间度过一生——再幸福不过了。

@ending ending_beloved
# en: Hand in Hand
title [b32cc8] = 携手同行
# en: Graduation is a blur of robes and cheers, but what you remember is a hand finding yours as the hats go up. Whatever comes next, you won't face it alone. Lumenhold taught you magic; it also taught you this.
text [ad5713] = 毕业典礼是长袍与欢呼交织的一片模糊，但你记得的，是帽子抛向空中时，一只手找到了你的手。无论接下来是什么，你都不会独自面对。流明堡教会了你魔法；也教会了你这个。

@ending ending_alchemist
# en: Master of the Crucible
title [cd1134] = 坩埚大师
# en: Your potions are already sold under the counter in three cities. On graduation day you sign the lease on a crooked little shop by the harbour. The sign reads your name, and underneath: NO REFUNDS FOR TRANSFORMATIONS.
text [59bc7c] = 你的药剂早已在三座城市里私下热销。毕业那天，你在港口边签下了一间歪歪扭扭的小铺子的租约。招牌上写着你的名字，下面一行小字：变形类商品，概不退款。

@ending ending_celebrity
# en: The Name on Every Lip
title [264e3e] = 人人口中的名字
# en: The Lumen Ledger runs a special edition about you. First-years queue for your autograph. You graduate as the most talked-about student in a generation, and the world beyond the gates is already waiting to hear what you'll do next.
text [208c47] = 《流明纪事报》为你出了一期特刊。一年级新生排队找你签名。你作为一代人中最受热议的学生毕业，而校门外的世界，早已等着听你接下来要做什么。

@ending ending_merchant
# en: Gold in the Vaults
title [2332ee] = 金库满盈
# en: You leave Lumenhold with a diploma and a fortune. Magic, you've decided, is good, but compound interest is better. Within five years your trading house has offices in every port — and an enchanted ledger that never loses a coin.
text [729e03] = 你带着一纸文凭和一笔财富离开了流明堡。你认定：魔法固然好，复利更好。不出五年，你的商行在每个港口都设了分号——还有一本永远不会少一枚硬币的魔法账簿。

@ending ending_shadow
# en: The Quiet Hand
title [9eb5a5] = 无声之手
# en: No one quite knows how you graduated with those grades. No one quite remembers the favours you called in. A discreet letter offers you a position with the Crown's Office of Unseen Affairs. You accept, of course. You'd already read it before it was sent.
text [0900ac] = 没人说得清你是怎么凭那样的成绩毕业的。也没人记得你讨回了哪些人情。一封措辞谨慎的信，邀请你加入王室隐秘事务署。你当然接受了。信还没寄出，你就已经读过了。

@ending ending_beloved_friends
# en: The Ones Who Stayed
title [5337c3] = 留下来的人
# en: You may not leave as the brightest or the richest, but you leave surrounded. Your friends throw their hats higher than anyone's, and the photograph from that day — all of you squinting into the sun — will hang in every home you ever have.
text [8d3051] = 你离开时也许不是最聪明的，也不是最富有的，但你被大家簇拥着。你的朋友们把帽子抛得比谁都高；那天的合影——大家都在阳光里眯着眼——会挂在你今后住过的每一个家里。

@ending ending_barely
# en: By the Skin of Your Teeth
title [434e96] = 惊险过关
# en: Your name is called last, after a long pause and some whispering between examiners. But it is called. You graduate. You are a mage of Lumenhold, and nobody ever has to know the details.
text [7c93a5] = 在一段长长的停顿和考官之间的窃窃私语之后，你的名字最后一个被念到。但终究被念到了。你毕业了。你是流明堡的法师，没人需要知道其中的细节。

@ending ending_bystander
# en: Someone Else's Lantern
title [93af7a] = 别人的灯笼
# en: There was a spring frost, the year you graduated, and a night when the bell under the lake would not stop ringing. You were somewhere else: asleep, or studying, or holding a door shut for the first-years. Someone else went down with the lantern. You never learn their whole story, but every spring, when the lake thaws, you find yourself grateful to them.
text [737b03] = 你毕业那年下过一场春霜，还有一个夜晚，湖底的钟响个不停。那时你在别处：在睡觉，在读书，或是替一年级生死死顶住一扇门。提着灯笼下去的是别人。你始终没能知道他们的全部故事，但每年春天湖水解冻时，你总会发现自己在心里默默感谢他们。

@ending ending_graduate
# en: A Mage of Lumenhold
title [691b6b] = 流明堡的法师
# en: Robes, hats, a speech that runs long. You walk out of the gates of Lumenhold a qualified mage — not legendary, not disgraced, simply yourself, with three years of stories and a whole world to spend them in.
text [3ae045] = 长袍、学位帽，一场拖得太长的致辞。你作为一名合格的法师走出流明堡的大门——不算传奇，也不丢人，只是你自己，带着三年的故事，和一整个可以挥霍它们的世界。

@ending ending_teacher
# en: The Teacher's Desk
title [b21115] = 讲台之后
# en: In the autumn you return to Lumenhold — not on the student barge, but on the faculty one. Your classroom has a window over the lake and a desk with somebody else's initials carved in it. On the first day a terrified first-year asks a question you once asked. You know exactly what to say.
text [dce2bc] = 秋天，你回到了流明堡——不是坐学生的驳船，而是坐教职员的那一艘。你的教室有一扇面朝湖水的窗，讲桌上刻着别人的名字缩写。开学第一天，一个吓坏了的一年级生问了一个你当年也问过的问题。你完全知道该怎么回答。

@ending ending_wanderer
# en: The Road of Wonders
title [055eab] = 奇迹之路
# en: You join the Travelling Circus of Wonders as its youngest illusionist. For years you cross the kingdoms in a painted wagon, making dragons out of moonlight for children who have never seen magic. Every winter, a letter arrives from Lumenhold. You always write back.
text [31dcb2] = 你加入了奇迹巡回马戏团，成了团里最年轻的幻术师。多年来，你坐着彩绘马车穿越一个又一个王国，用月光为从未见过魔法的孩子们变出巨龙。每年冬天，都会有一封来自流明堡的信。你每一封都回。

@ending ending_dumonts_reunited
# en: Two Dumonts in the Photograph
title [51d393] = 合影里的两个杜蒙
# en: In the graduation photograph, at the edge of the crowd, two pale heads lean together: Kael, and the sister who was raised to open the door he refused. Neither of them is smiling at the camera. They are smiling at each other, which is rarer, and which you helped to happen.
text [d79ff1] = 毕业合影里，人群边上，两颗浅色的脑袋靠在一起：凯尔，和那个被养大来打开他拒绝打开的那扇门的妹妹。他们谁都没有对着镜头笑。他们是在对彼此笑——这更难得，而你帮了这个忙。

@ending ending_ilse_taken
# en: A Chair Left Empty
title [c33d8b] = 一把空着的椅子
# en: The man in grey took Ilse north, and no letter has come. At graduation Kael keeps the seat beside him empty without saying why. You know why. Some evenings, when the lake goes very still, you still look for a girl in white furs on the far shore.
text [9df500] = 灰衣人把伊尔泽带去了北境，至今没有一封信。毕业典礼上，凯尔身旁的座位一直空着，他没说为什么。你知道为什么。有些傍晚，湖面静得出奇的时候，你仍会在对岸寻找一个穿白裘的女孩。

@ending ending_lumen
# en: A Lantern for Others
title [217ba6] = 为他人提灯的人
# en: In the yearbook, under your portrait, someone has written: "The one you went to when it mattered." First-years you barely remember will name their own lanterns after you. Lumenhold has a word for people like that. It is the same word as its name.
text [2de9cf] = 年鉴上，你的肖像下面有人写了一句：“要紧的时候，大家去找的那个人。”你几乎记不得的一年级生，日后会用你的名字给自己的灯笼命名。流明堡对这样的人有个说法——就是它自己的名字。

@ending ending_hollow_touched
# en: The Shadow at Your Heel
title [b9eb7a] = 跟在脚边的影子
# en: Your portrait in the yearbook is the only one where the candles behind you seem to have gone out. People step aside when you pass, not quite knowing why. The Hollow has learned your name, and you find, more and more often, that you answer to it.
text [7dd587] = 整本年鉴里，只有你的肖像身后的烛火像是熄了。人们在你经过时让开路，却说不清为什么。空洞已经知道了你的名字，而你越来越常发现，自己会应声。
